    "body": "## Summary\n\nBump the MoRI pin in the ROCm Docker image from `879983bdbd8c65c52e9f79ad836a61cbffef98b6` (v1.2.3) to `f39fa765e897c95995957d0518908cc982a88fc2`, the commit of the [`v1.2.4`](https://github.com/ROCm/mori/releases/tag/v1.2.4) tag. The full SHA is used instead of the tag name to keep the build reproducible.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- Verified `refs/tags/v1.2.4^{}` resolves to `f39fa765e897c95995957d0518908cc982a88fc2`.\n- Verified the previous pin is an ancestor of the new pin (73 commits ahead).\n- `git diff --check`\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #38236562295](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38236562295)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38236561882](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38236561882)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38236561985](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38236561985)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
